   191	Branch B exact Moh system.  COUNTING-BOUND[SOURCE-OMITTED].  Moh prints
   192	`Omega`, five leading terms, `J=x`, and the count 11; he does not print the
   193	11 variables or equations.  I did not invent monomial support from the leading
   194	terms alone.
