   196	Branch C, missing `1+1+1` cubic partition.  COUNTING-BOUND[SOURCE-OMITTED].
   197	The page excludes it by assertion only: "precisely two roots" is printed, but
   198	no local hypothesis check or coefficient exclusion is displayed.  No
   199	corresponding `Omega` normal form or system is in pp.207--211.
