   326	
   327	Moh says this fourth degree class has “complications.”  From the distribution
   328	of roots of `g` in `D^*_2`, the leading polynomial `g_sigma(pi)` is either
   329	(i) a power of a linear polynomial, or (ii) the ninth power of a cubic with
